  "description": "AnyMediator (formerly OpenMediatR) is a free, open-source (Apache-2.0) in-process mediator for .NET and a MediatR alternative with a MediatR-compatible API: requests, streaming requests, notifications, pipeline behaviors, pre/post-processors, exception handlers/actions and pluggable notification sinks. Independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by MediatR or Lucky Penny Software.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
