  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: performance. No API or behavior change.\n- Requests, streams and notifications are dispatched through generic wrappers built once per message type, without reflection. Send with no behaviors: 457 ns / 360 B in 2.1.0, 97 ns / 96 B now (MediatR 12.5: 92 ns / 200 B). Publish with one handler: 379 ns / 656 B in 2.1.0, 196 ns / 344 B now.\n- Simpler runtime library: about 20% less code.\n- Benchmarks against MediatR and Mediator: https://adiakys.github.io/AnyMediator/guide/performance",
